{"id":"a9f2cffd9da7a09c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms.md","title":"Kalish–Montague–Tarski Axiom Schemes L1–L7","display":"df-smullyan-logical-axioms — Kalish–Montague–Tarski Axiom Schemes L1–L7","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms"],"display":"df-smullyan-logical-axioms — Kalish–Montague–Tarski Axiom Schemes L1–L7","source":"第 III 章 pp. 28–30（PDF 45–47）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-logical-axioms — Kalish–Montague–Tarski Axiom Schemes L1–L7"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 28–30（PDF 45–47）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"72f7b5109e33fa0f\" href=\"?note=72f7b5109e33fa0f\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-free-variables\">92-df-smullyan-free-variables</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\in\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{1,2,3\\}\\}\">\\(J\\in\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{1,2,3\\}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,H,U\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\">\\(F,H,U\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=v_i^E\">\\(v=v_i^E\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>原书造串构造器、派生联结词与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Occ}_E\">\\(\\mathrm{Occ}_E\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"72f7b5109e33fa0f\" href=\"?note=72f7b5109e33fa0f\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-free-variables\">92-df-smullyan-free-variables</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v,t}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v,t}\\)</span> 是以下结构递归定义的有限集合值函数，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j},\\operatorname{eq}_E,\\operatorname{le}_E\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j},\\operatorname{eq}_E,\\operatorname{le}_E\\)</span> 为原书项/公式构造器。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对原子公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OneRep}_E(C,v,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{OneRep}_E(C,v,t)\\)</span> 是在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的项树中恰选一个标签为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的变量叶、换成项树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 后重新输出所得串的集合；没有这样的叶时取空集。局部递归变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,u,r\">\\(s,u,r\\)</span> 为项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\geq1\">\\(i,j\\geq1\\)</span>；二元函数条款的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in J\">\\(j\\in J\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{At}_{E,J}\">\\(\\mathrm{At}_{E,J}\\)</span> 为原书原子公式集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{r,J},\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J}\">\\(L_{r,J},\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J}\\)</span> 为下文引入的公理实例集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}logical\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(\\nu_n^E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(v_j^E)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\{t\\}&amp;j=i,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(s&#39;)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{r&#39;:r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(s)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,u))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(r,u):r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(s)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8mm}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,r):r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(u)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{OneRep}_E(\\operatorname{rel}_E(s,u),v,t)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{rel}_E(r,u):r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v,t}(s)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8mm}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rel}_E(s,r):r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v,t}(u)\\}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{rel}\\in\\{\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{le}\\}),\\\\\nL_{1,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\supset(H\\supset F):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\nL_{2,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(F\\supset(H\\supset U))\\supset((F\\supset H)\\supset(F\\supset U)):F,H,U\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\nL_{3,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\neg_E F\\supset\\neg_E H)\\supset(H\\supset F):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\nL_{4,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\forall v(F\\supset H))\\supset((\\forall vF)\\supset(\\forall vH)):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},v\\in V_E\\},\\\\\nL_{5,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\supset\\forall vF:F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},v\\in V_E\\setminus\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\},\\\\\nL_{6,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\exists_E v(v=t):t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J},v\\in V_E\\setminus\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t)\\},\\\\\nL_{7,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(v=t)\\supset(C\\supset D):C\\in\\mathrm{At}_{E,J},t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J},v\\in V_E,D\\in\\operatorname{OneRep}_E(C,v,t)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r=1}^7 L_{r,J}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}logical\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(\\nu_n^E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(v_j^E)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\{t\\}&amp;j=i,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(s&#39;)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{r&#39;:r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(s)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,u))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(r,u):r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(s)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8mm}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,r):r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(u)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{OneRep}_E(\\operatorname{rel}_E(s,u),v,t)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{rel}_E(r,u):r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v,t}(s)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8mm}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rel}_E(s,r):r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v,t}(u)\\}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{rel}\\in\\{\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{le}\\}),\\\\\nL_{1,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\supset(H\\supset F):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\nL_{2,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(F\\supset(H\\supset U))\\supset((F\\supset H)\\supset(F\\supset U)):F,H,U\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\nL_{3,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\neg_E F\\supset\\neg_E H)\\supset(H\\supset F):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\nL_{4,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\forall v(F\\supset H))\\supset((\\forall vF)\\supset(\\forall vH)):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},v\\in V_E\\},\\\\\nL_{5,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\supset\\forall vF:F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},v\\in V_E\\setminus\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\},\\\\\nL_{6,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\exists_E v(v=t):t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J},v\\in V_E\\setminus\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t)\\},\\\\\nL_{7,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(v=t)\\supset(C\\supset D):C\\in\\mathrm{At}_{E,J},t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J},v\\in V_E,D\\in\\operatorname{OneRep}_E(C,v,t)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r=1}^7 L_{r,J}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_E=\\{v_i^E:i\\geq1\\}\">\\(V_E=\\{v_i^E:i\\geq1\\}\\)</span>。L7 只替换一个出现，既不要求替换所有自由出现，也不是任意公式上的一般代换模式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OneRep}_E\">\\(\\operatorname{OneRep}_E\\)</span> 的操作域有限，按原子公式的项树定义，未引入无来源的全局替换原语。</p>\n<p>L5 的 side condition 按原书采用“不出现”。L6 的存在量词必须展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_E\\forall v\\neg_E(v=t)\">\\(\\neg_E\\forall v\\neg_E(v=t)\\)</span>。本组是原书七个模式；本地 G 的另一套逻辑公理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a>。</p>\n<p>替换只在项构造的变量叶等于整个 v 时发生。尤其 v₁ 的字符可能是 v₂ 名串的前缀，不能用 C=Xv₁Y 的字符串分解代替实际变量出现；换成另一个变量名后仍可能产生合法原子公式，但语义会错误。上述 Rep 在数码处为空，在匹配的完整变量叶处为 {t}，函数构造只沿一个分支递归，故严格替换一个真实出现；所有输出仍是同语言的项或原子公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-free-variables","status":"resolved","id":"72f7b5109e33fa0f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-free-variables","status":"resolved","id":"72f7b5109e33fa0f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"原书造串构造器、派生联结词与 $\\mathrm{Occ}_E$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logical-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"e948c25f4a467fa1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"L5 的 side condition 按原书采用“不出现”。L6 的存在量词必须展开为 $\\neg_E\\forall v\\neg_E(v=t)$。本组是原书七个模式；本地 G 的另一套逻辑公理见 [[92-df-logical-axiom]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J\\in\\{\\{1,2\\},\\{1,2,3\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F,H,U\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}","display":false},{"tex":"v=v_i^E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Occ}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v,t}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j},\\operatorname{eq}_E,\\operatorname{le}_E","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OneRep}_E(C,v,t)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"s,u,r","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{At}_{E,J}","display":false},{"tex":"L_{r,J},\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}logical\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(\\nu_n^E)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(v_j^E)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\{t\\}&j=i,\\\\\\varnothing&j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(s')&\\coloneqq\n\\{r':r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(s)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,u))&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(r,u):r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(s)\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{8mm}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,r):r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v_i,t}(u)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{OneRep}_E(\\operatorname{rel}_E(s,u),v,t)&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{rel}_E(r,u):r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v,t}(s)\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{8mm}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rel}_E(s,r):r\\in\\operatorname{Rep}_{E,v,t}(u)\\}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{rel}\\in\\{\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{le}\\}),\\\\\nL_{1,J}&\\coloneqq\\{F\\supset(H\\supset F):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\nL_{2,J}&\\coloneqq\\{(F\\supset(H\\supset U))\\supset((F\\supset H)\\supset(F\\supset U)):F,H,U\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\nL_{3,J}&\\coloneqq\\{(\\neg_E F\\supset\\neg_E H)\\supset(H\\supset F):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\nL_{4,J}&\\coloneqq\\{(\\forall v(F\\supset H))\\supset((\\forall vF)\\supset(\\forall vH)):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},v\\in V_E\\},\\\\\nL_{5,J}&\\coloneqq\\{F\\supset\\forall vF:F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},v\\in V_E\\setminus\\mathrm{Occ}_E(F)\\},\\\\\nL_{6,J}&\\coloneqq\\{\\exists_E v(v=t):t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J},v\\in V_E\\setminus\\mathrm{Occ}_E(t)\\},\\\\\nL_{7,J}&\\coloneqq\\{(v=t)\\supset(C\\supset D):C\\in\\mathrm{At}_{E,J},t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J},v\\in V_E,D\\in\\operatorname{OneRep}_E(C,v,t)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J}&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{r=1}^7 L_{r,J}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V_E=\\{v_i^E:i\\geq1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OneRep}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_E\\forall v\\neg_E(v=t)","display":false}],"bytes":3967,"backlinks":[{"id":"ffee1dd616b0911b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书将 A(x) 拆成十九个模式的算术公式。本文 Axiom_F 是通用码成员关系，任意系统的公理集并不自动有效；原书的明确模式见 [[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]] 和 [[92-df-smullyan-induction]]。"},{"id":"b2016a44e2de38ce","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 Group I 只有 L1–L3，因 ∧、∨ 是派生缩写。本文额外六组模式用于 G 的原始 ∧、∨，原书七模式整体见 [[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]。"},{"id":"920841c1841d30c3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]]、[[92-df-smullyan-induction]] → [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]] → [[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]] → [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-correctness]]。L7 采用完整变量叶的单出现递归；N12 采用原书双层量词包装。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]"}],"outgoing":["72f7b5109e33fa0f","e948c25f4a467fa1"]}